---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="專屬邀請 | 第一屆臺灣青少年科學發展論壇">
	<div class="panel">
		<div class="panel-inner">
			<a href="/forum/2026">← 返回論壇詳情</a>

			<h2>專屬邀請報名</h2>
			<p class="notice">感謝您受邀參與第一屆臺灣青少年科學發展論壇。</p>

			<div class="steps">
				<div class="step">
					<span class="step-num">1</span>
					<div>
						<h3>完成匯款</h3>
						<p>請依下方資訊完成報名費匯款，並記下匯款帳號後五碼、日期與金額。</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="step">
					<span class="step-num">2</span>
					<div>
						<h3>填寫報名表單</h3>
						<p>匯款完成後，請填寫線上表單並附上匯款資訊，完成初步報名。</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="step">
					<span class="step-num">3</span>
					<div>
						<h3>等待確認通知</h3>
						<p>我們將於確認匯款後，以 Email 通知您報名成功，此時報名才正式完成。</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="payment-info">
				<h3>匯款資訊</h3>
				<p>銀行：（待補）</p>
				<p>戶名：（待補）</p>
				<p>帳號：（待補）</p>
				<p>報名費：（待補）</p>
			</div>

			<a href="#" class="register-button">前往報名表單</a>
		</div>
	</div>

	<style>
		.panel {
			background: var(--panel-bg);
			color: var(--card-text);
			padding-top: var(--header-h, 90px);
		}
		.panel h1, .panel h2, .panel h3 {
			color: var(--card-text);
		}
		.panel-inner {
			max-width: 800px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		}
		.notice {
			color: var(--orange);
			font-weight: 600;
			margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem;
		}
		.steps {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1.25rem;
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
		}
		.step {
			display: flex;
			gap: 1rem;
			align-items: flex-start;
		}
		.step-num {
			flex-shrink: 0;
			width: 32px;
			height: 32px;
			border-radius: 50%;
			background: var(--orange);
			color: #FFFFFF;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
		}
		.step h3 {
			margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
			font-size: 1rem;
		}
		.step p {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			color: var(--card-text-muted);
		}
		.payment-info {
			background: var(--card-bg);
			border-radius: 12px;
			padding: 1.5rem;
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
		}
		.payment-info h3 {
			margin: 0 0 1rem;
		}
		.payment-info p {
			margin: 0.4rem 0;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
		}
		.register-button {
			display: inline-block;
			background: var(--orange);
			color: #FFFFFF;
			padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem;
			border-radius: 8px;
			font-weight: 600;
			text-decoration: none;
		}
		.register-button:hover {
			opacity: 0.9;
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
